  "ingredients": [
    "0.75 cup water",
    "salt to taste",
    "2 cups peeled pearl onions",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "1.5 cups cold whole milk",
    "0.25 cup quick-mixing flour (such as Wondra®), or more as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/05vrhQcak5bcLpfFN6er6CDvqq8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/232237-easy-creamed-onions-DDMFS-145-4x3-step-01-3807c0a814ee4a1a91d2963ed986f6a1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232237/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring water and salt to a boil in a small saucepan; add pearl onions and cook until just tender, 5 to 10 minutes. Drain, reserving 1/2 cup water in the saucepan; return onions to the pan and add butter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mVggVNUJ4rV7YKRXp-IL81c0g3Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/232237-easy-creamed-onions-DDMFS-148-4x3-step-02-a8580911dbd246e88ef6070dddeba58e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232237/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk milk and quick-mixing flour together in a small bowl until smooth; add to the onion mixture. Cook and stir over medium-low heat until thickened, 10 to 15 minutes. Stir in more quick-mixing flour, 1 teaspoon at a time, if the mixture is too thin.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Lc3dV9GR73aVCCPDn1MZUw68Pd0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/232237-easy-creamed-onions-DDMFS-149-4x3-step-03-2cf6461748154ec1aba83a00a5544995.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232237/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season with additional salt to taste and serve hot. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jzsgpRlohKtwcTzTAjfS5vapFnk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/232237-easy-creamed-onions-DDMFS-162-4x3-beauty--1879aecf680c4faf923ba0c1a29a1a2a.jpg"
      ],
